From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kc <kc@localhost>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make each rule's path filters once, not for each file

Analyzer checked each rule's includes and excludes, and its rule set's,
for each file by compiling their globs into new PathFilters: some
100,000 compilations on kotlinx-coroutines-core with --all-rules. The
filters of each config are made once now, and each file's relative path
once.

Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../main/kotlin/dev/detekt/core/Analyzer.kt   | 31 +++++++++++++++----
 .../dev/detekt/core/util/ConfigExtensions.kt  |  9 +++++-
 2 files changed, 33 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/detekt-core/src/main/kotlin/dev/detekt/core/Analyzer.kt b/detekt-core/src/main/kotlin/dev/detekt/core/Analyzer.kt
index 4d5b2cb..d8b4544 100644
--- a/detekt-core/src/main/kotlin/dev/detekt/core/Analyzer.kt
